Z||000028||Jeff Blowers||11-22-2001||07:20 PM||||I have to agree with grinthock.  I also use Oliver's scantool.  Actually I think it is only $75 with shipping from Germany to the US.  He is very responsive on email, and ships right away.  Also there is other add-on software for it, or you can simply use a terminal program on your laptop, capture the data and then load it into Excel for charting and graphing as you want.<P>His web site is <A HREF="http://home.t-online.de/home/O_Scholz/fieroidx.html" TARGET=_blank>http://home.t-online.de/home/O_Scholz/fieroidx.html</A> ||||reg||1
